  "items": [
    {
      "source": "This callback is only required for resolution of bean names in the\n<a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setBeans(java.util.Map)\"><code>\"beans\"</code></a> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> and for\nauto-detection of MBeans (in the latter case, a\n<code>ListableBeanFactory</code> is required).",
      "translation": "此回调仅在解析 `<a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setBeans(java.util.Map)\"><code>\"beans\"</code></a> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 中的 Bean 名称以及自动检测 MBeans（在后一种情况下，需要 `<code>ListableBeanFactory</code>`）时是必需的。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets a <a href=\"../naming/MetadataNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.naming\"><code>MetadataNamingStrategy</code></a> and a <a href=\"../assembler/MetadataMBeanInfoAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.assembler\"><code>MetadataMBeanInfoAssembler</code></a>\nwith an <a href=\"AnnotationJmxAttributeSource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>AnnotationJmxAttributeSource</code></a>, and activates\n<a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setAutodetect(boolean)\"><code>autodetection</code></a> by default.",
      "translation": "设置一个 `<a href=\"../naming/MetadataNamingStrategy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.naming\"><code>MetadataNamingStrategy</code></a>` 和一个 `<a href=\"../assembler/MetadataMBeanInfoAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.assembler\"><code>MetadataMBeanInfoAssembler</code></a>`，并配合一个 `<a href=\"AnnotationJmxAttributeSource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.annotation\"><code>AnnotationJmxAttributeSource</code></a>`，默认激活 `<a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setAutodetect(boolean)\"><code>autodetection</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default is to use the domain specified in the bean name\n(if the bean name follows the JMX ObjectName syntax); else,\nthe package name of the managed bean class.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，使用 bean 名称中指定的域（如果 bean 名称遵循 JMX ObjectName 语法）；否则，使用托管 bean 类的包名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">MBeanExporter</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">MBeanExporter</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\">MBeanExporter</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code>` 类中的 `<code><a href=\"../MBeanExporter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export\">MBeanExporter</a></code>`",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Specify the default domain to be used for generating ObjectNames\nwhen no source-level metadata has been specified.",
      "translation": "指定在尚未指定源代码级别元数据时，用于生成 ObjectNames 的默认域。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - owning BeanFactory (never <code>null</code>).\nThe bean can immediately call methods on the factory.",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 拥有该 Bean 的 BeanFactory（永远不会为 <code>null</code>）。\n该 Bean 可以立即调用工厂上的方法。",
